# Keep runtime dependencies for the attachment parsers (pdfjs-dist, mammoth,
# xlsx, jszip). vsce bundles `dependencies` and skips `devDependencies` by
# default; do NOT blanket-exclude node_modules or the published .vsix will be
# missing them and file attachment will fail at runtime.
